{"seq":3,"slug":"toolchain-engineering","title":"现代工程化工具链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/electron-desktop/development/toolchain-engineering","wordCount":586,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"现代工程化工具链\">现代工程化工具链</h1><p>Electron 应用的开发体验曾长期落后于纯 Web 项目——缺乏 HMR、构建配置分散、三个进程（main/preload/renderer）各自为政。2026 年，以 electron-vite 和 Electron Forge 为代表的现代工具链彻底改变了这一局面：统一的构建配置管理三个进程、亚秒级开发服务器启动、即时 HMR，以及从开发到签名发布的完整 pipeline。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[源码] --&gt; B[electron-vite]&#10;    B --&gt; C[main bundle]&#10;    B --&gt; D[preload bundle]&#10;    B --&gt; E[renderer dev server / bundle]&#10;&#10;    F[Electron Forge] --&gt; G[打包 .app/.exe/.deb]&#10;    F --&gt; H[代码签名 + 公证]&#10;    F --&gt; I[发布到更新服务器]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; F&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F\">graph LR\n    A[源码] --&gt; B[electron-vite]\n    B --&gt; C[main bundle]\n    B --&gt; D[preload bundle]\n    B --&gt; E[renderer dev server / bundle]\n\n    F[Electron Forge] --&gt; G[打包 .app/.exe/.deb]\n    F --&gt; H[代码签名 + 公证]\n    F --&gt; I[发布到更新服务器]\n\n    C --&gt; F\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>替代方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>electron-vite</td>\n<td>统一构建 main/preload/renderer</td>\n<td>electron-webpack、手动多配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Electron Forge</td>\n<td>打包、签名、分发</td>\n<td>electron-builder</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Playwright</td>\n<td>E2E 测试</td>\n<td>Spectron（已弃用）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>electron-rebuild</td>\n<td>重编译原生模块</td>\n<td>node-gyp 手动调用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"electron-vite-统一构建\">electron-vite 统一构建</h2><p>electron-vite 为 Electron 的三个进程提供统一的 Vite 配置入口，每个进程可独立配置但共享公共选项：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// electron.vite.config.ts&#10;import { defineConfig, externalizeDepsPlugin } from &#39;electron-vite&#39;;&#10;import react from &#39;@vitejs/plugin-react&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default defineConfig({&#10;  main: {&#10;    plugins: [externalizeDepsPlugin()],&#10;    build: {&#10;      rollupOptions: {&#10;        input: { index: &#39;src/main/index.ts&#39; },&#10;      },&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;  preload: {&#10;    plugins: [externalizeDepsPlugin()],&#10;    build: {&#10;      rollupOptions: {&#10;        input: { index: &#39;src/preload/index.ts&#39; },&#10;      },&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;  renderer: {&#10;    plugins: [react()],&#10;    root: &#39;src/renderer&#39;,&#10;    build: {&#10;      rollupOptions: {&#10;        input: { index: &#39;src/renderer/index.html&#39; },&#10;      },&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// electron.vite.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { defineConfig, externalizeDepsPlugin } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'electron-vite'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> react </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@vitejs/plugin-react'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  main: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    plugins: [</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">externalizeDepsPlugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    build: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      rollupOptions: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        input: { index: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'src/main/index.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  preload: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    plugins: [</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">externalizeDepsPlugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    build: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      rollupOptions: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        input: { index: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'src/preload/index.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  renderer: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    plugins: [</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">react</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    root: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'src/renderer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    build: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      rollupOptions: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        input: { index: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'src/renderer/index.html'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>开发模式下的工作流程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>启动 renderer 的 Vite dev server（端口如 5173）</li>\n<li>构建 main 和 preload 到内存/临时目录</li>\n<li>启动 Electron 进程，主窗口加载 <code>http://localhost:5173</code></li>\n<li>main/preload 文件变更时自动重启 Electron 进程</li>\n<li>renderer 变更时通过 Vite HMR 即时热更新，无需重启</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"推荐项目结构\">推荐项目结构</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"my-electron-app/&#10;├── src/&#10;│   ├── main/           # 主进程代码&#10;│   │   ├── index.ts    # 入口：app 生命周期、窗口创建&#10;│   │   └── ipc/        # IPC handler 按功能模块拆分&#10;│   ├── preload/        # preload 脚本&#10;│   │   ├── index.ts    # contextBridge 暴露&#10;│   │   └── index.d.ts  # 类型声明&#10;│   └── renderer/       # React/Vue 渲染进程&#10;│       ├── src/&#10;│       └── index.html&#10;├── electron.vite.config.ts&#10;├── forge.config.ts&#10;└── package.json\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>my-electron-app/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── main/           # 主进程代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── index.ts    # 入口：app 生命周期、窗口创建</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── ipc/        # IPC handler 按功能模块拆分</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── preload/        # preload 脚本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── index.ts    # contextBridge 暴露</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── index.d.ts  # 类型声明</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── renderer/       # React/Vue 渲染进程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── index.html</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── electron.vite.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── forge.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── package.json</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"electron-forge-打包与分发\">Electron Forge 打包与分发</h2><p>Electron Forge 是官方推荐的打包工具，覆盖从源码到可分发安装包的完整流程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// forge.config.ts&#10;import type { ForgeConfig } from &#39;@electron-forge/shared-types&#39;;&#10;import { MakerSquirrel } from &#39;@electron-forge/maker-squirrel&#39;;&#10;import { MakerDMG } from &#39;@electron-forge/maker-dmg&#39;;&#10;import { MakerDeb } from &#39;@electron-forge/maker-deb&#39;;&#10;&#10;const config: ForgeConfig = {&#10;  packagerConfig: {&#10;    asar: true,&#10;    icon: &#39;./assets/icon&#39;,&#10;    appBundleId: &#39;com.example.myapp&#39;,&#10;    osxSign: {},&#10;    osxNotarize: {&#10;      appleId: process.env.APPLE_ID!,&#10;      appleIdPassword: process.env.APPLE_PASSWORD!,&#10;      teamId: process.env.APPLE_TEAM_ID!,&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;  makers: [&#10;    new MakerSquirrel({ setupIcon: &#39;./assets/icon.ico&#39; }),&#10;    new MakerDMG({ format: &#39;ULFO&#39; }),&#10;    new MakerDeb({ options: { categories: [&#39;Utility&#39;] } }),&#10;  ],&#10;  publishers: [&#10;    {&#10;      name: &#39;@electron-forge/publisher-github&#39;,&#10;      config: { repository: { owner: &#39;org&#39;, name: &#39;app&#39; } },&#10;    },&#10;  ],&#10;};&#10;&#10;export default config;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// forge.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ForgeConfig } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@electron-forge/shared-types'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { MakerSquirrel } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@electron-forge/maker-squirrel'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { MakerDMG } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@electron-forge/maker-dmg'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { MakerDeb } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@electron-forge/maker-deb'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ForgeConfig</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  packagerConfig: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    asar: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    icon: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./assets/icon'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    appBundleId: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'com.example.myapp'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    osxSign: {},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    osxNotarize: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      appleId: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">APPLE_ID</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      appleIdPassword: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">APPLE_PASSWORD</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      teamId: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">APPLE_TEAM_ID</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  makers: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MakerSquirrel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ setupIcon: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./assets/icon.ico'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MakerDMG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ format: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ULFO'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MakerDeb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ options: { categories: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Utility'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] } }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  publishers: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@electron-forge/publisher-github'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      config: { repository: { owner: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'org'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'app'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"开发调试工具集成\">开发调试工具集成</h2><p>现代 Electron 开发栈集成了丰富的调试能力：</p>\n<p><strong>Chrome DevTools</strong>：每个 BrowserWindow 都可通过 <code>win.webContents.openDevTools()</code> 打开完整的 Chrome DevTools，用于调试渲染进程。</p>\n<p><strong>主进程调试</strong>：通过 <code>--inspect</code> 或 <code>--inspect-brk</code> 启动参数连接 Node.js 调试器（VS Code 的 Attach to Process 配置）。</p>\n<p><strong>Electron DevTools Extension</strong>：React DevTools、Vue DevTools 等浏览器扩展可通过 <code>session.defaultSession.loadExtension()</code> 加载到 Electron 中。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 开发模式下加载 React DevTools&#10;if (!app.isPackaged) {&#10;  const { default: installExtension, REACT_DEVELOPER_TOOLS } = await import(&#39;electron-devtools-installer&#39;);&#10;  await installExtension(REACT_DEVELOPER_TOOLS);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 开发模式下加载 React DevTools</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">app.isPackaged) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">installExtension</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">REACT_DEVELOPER_TOOLS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'electron-devtools-installer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> installExtension</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">REACT_DEVELOPER_TOOLS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"e2e-测试策略\">E2E 测试策略</h2><p>Spectron 已于 2022 年弃用，现代 Electron 应用推荐使用 Playwright 进行端到端测试：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// e2e/app.test.ts&#10;import { test, expect, _electron as electron } from &#39;@playwright/test&#39;;&#10;&#10;test(&#39;应用启动并显示主窗口&#39;, async () =&gt; {&#10;  const app = await electron.launch({ args: [&#39;.&#39;] });&#10;  const window = await app.firstWindow();&#10;&#10;  await expect(window.locator(&#39;h1&#39;)).toHaveText(&#39;Welcome&#39;);&#10;&#10;  const title = await window.title();&#10;  expect(title).toBe(&#39;My App&#39;);&#10;&#10;  await app.close();&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// e2e/app.test.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { test, expect, _electron </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> electron } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@playwright/test'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'应用启动并显示主窗口'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> app</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> electron.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">launch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ args: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> window</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> app.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">firstWindow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(window.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">locator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'h1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toHaveText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Welcome'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> title</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> window.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">title</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(title).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'My App'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> app.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Playwright 对 Electron 的支持包括：多窗口管理、IPC 模拟、文件对话框拦截、截图对比等。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>electron-vite 统一管理 main/preload/renderer 三个进程的构建，提供亚秒级 HMR</li>\n<li>Electron Forge 覆盖打包、签名、公证和发布的完整 pipeline</li>\n<li>项目结构按进程职责组织：<code>src/main/</code>、<code>src/preload/</code>、<code>src/renderer/</code></li>\n<li>调试集成：Chrome DevTools + Node.js Inspector + 框架 DevTools Extension</li>\n<li>E2E 测试使用 Playwright，Spectron 已弃用</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"window-management\">窗口管理与多窗口架构</a>——工程化工具链如何服务多窗口场景</li>\n<li><a href=\"/hubs/frontend/build-tooling-bundlers/\">前端构建工具链深入</a>——Vite/Rollup 在 Electron 之外的通用构建知识</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"现代工程化工具链","id":"现代工程化工具链"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"electron-vite 统一构建","id":"electron-vite-统一构建"},{"level":2,"text":"推荐项目结构","id":"推荐项目结构"},{"level":2,"text":"Electron Forge 打包与分发","id":"electron-forge-打包与分发"},{"level":2,"text":"开发调试工具集成","id":"开发调试工具集成"},{"level":2,"text":"E2E 测试策略","id":"e2e-测试策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"BrowserWindow 窗口管理与多窗口架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/electron-desktop/development/window-management"},"next":{"title":"冷启动速度优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/electron-desktop/performance/cold-start-optimization"}}